  "description": "CAN Commander is a comprehensive tool designed for the reverse engineering of CAN (Controller Area Network) bus systems. This project aims to provide a robust platform for automotive enthusiasts, engineers, and security researchers to interact with and analyze CAN networks, facilitating a deeper understanding and manipulation of communication.",
